## 1. Purpose

This license makes the Theoros software and trained models open: anyone may
use, study, change and share them, for any purpose, free of charge. It also
gives every user a patent license, keeps the Theoros name and logo protected,
and asks that credit is kept.

## 2. Definitions

**"Licensor"** means Theoros and every Contributor, each for its own
Contribution.

**"Materials"** means everything distributed under this license, including
source code, object code, model architectures, trained model weights and
parameters, configuration files, documentation and data files, in any form.

**"Model Weights"** means the numerical parameters of a trained model,
including quantised, compiled or converted versions of them.

**"Derivative"** means any work based on the Materials, including modified
code, fine-tuned, pruned, quantised, distilled or compiled models, and models
trained using the Materials' code where the result contains a substantial part
of the Model Weights.

**"Contribution"** means any work submitted to Theoros for inclusion in the
Materials. **"Contributor"** means the owner of a Contribution.

**"You"** means the person or legal entity exercising rights under this
license.

