## How to apply this license

Put a copy of this file as `LICENSE` in the root of the repository, and a
`NOTICE` file with:

```
TheorosNet and related Materials
Copyright (c) 2026 Theoros
Licensed under the Theoros Open License 1.0.
```

For model releases, state the license in the model card and keep the NOTICE
text in the card.
